WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.510
Twins are mistaken for each other.

2
00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:06.180
A disguised figure is
chased by the wrong admirer.

3
00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:09.790
At midnight, a steward in
black breaks up a party:

4
00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:11.980
"My masters, are you mad?"

5
00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:15.810
A reveller answers back: "Art
any more than a steward?"

6
00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:20.080
Then everything freezes, and
the figures click into couples.

7
00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:22.610
Every comedy ends at the altar.

8
00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:23.750
Coincidence?

9
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:26.080
Or is it more than a happy ending?

10
00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:29.700
In this mission, you'll set
comedy's shape beside tragedy's,

11
00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:32.040
from the first scene to the last.

12
00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:34.720
You'll meet an ancient plot: young lovers,

13
00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:37.390
blocked by an old father or a rival.

14
00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:40.070
And you'll ask what
happens to the killjoy.

15
00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:43.820
Your mission: explain why a
wedding ending is a convention,

16
00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:45.580
not just a happy ending.
